# like: I was unsure here. The shift is from same-nature likeness (S6, S7) to likeness that rests only on sharing one behaviour (A2). C draws on the second sense and then transfers wisdom and goodness by the first.
# P2 and P3 are taken to be S3 and S5. Those statements are not quoted, so this assignment is inferred.
